      en: ["Named after the Trás-os-Montes region in Portugal.", "Located in the cooler, higher altitudes, ideal for coffee.", "Was originally a coffee plantation before cocoa became dominant.", "The architecture is typical of a coffee roça with large drying yards.", "An example of the economic adaptability of the plantations.", "Illustrates the island's changing agricultural history.", "The decaying buildings have a special, nostalgic charm."]
